Supplemental native channel SDK license declarations

The exact published npm versions below omit standalone license files. This file
records their published declarations and the sources of supplemental texts. It is
not an upstream NOTICE or a new grant of rights. It does not infer copyright
holders or resolve conflicting declarations.

