Standard texts supplementing published declarations
==================================================

Some upstream releases supply only a license name or link, without a full text.
The files below supply the referenced standard texts, not purported copies of
missing upstream files. MIT retains its unfilled copyright template fields.
ISC retains the standard text's original ISC attribution, which is not an
attribution for these SDK packages. No package-specific copyright is inferred.
Any copyright statement found in a published README is recorded below.

  MIT: sdk-MIT.LICENSE
  Source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/spdx/license-list-data/v3.27.0/text/MIT.txt
  ISC: sdk-ISC.LICENSE
  Source: https://raw.githubusercontent.com/spdx/license-list-data/v3.27.0/text/ISC.txt
  Apache-2.0: sdk-Apache-2.0.LICENSE
  Source: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0.txt

